      <article class="project-card reveal delay-1" data-category="energy">
        <div class="project-art"><span class="art-index">CONCEPT / 005</span><div class="art-orbit"></div><div class="art-core"></div><span class="art-type">ENERGY SYSTEMS</span></div>
        <div class="project-info">
          <h3>Energy Systems Explorer</h3>
          <p>An educational model comparing energy generation, storage, efficiency, and losses across selected renewable and conventional systems.</p>
