      <article class="roadmap-step reveal">
        <div class="roadmap-phase">PHASE / 01</div>
        <h3>Establish</h3>
        <p>Build a clear identity, organize research topics, publish educational material, and create a reliable digital home for the community.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="roadmap-step reveal delay-1">
        <div class="roadmap-phase">PHASE / 02</div>
        <h3>Research</h3>
        <p>Develop topic collections, document research questions, create learning resources, and investigate promising project concepts.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="roadmap-step reveal delay-2">
        <div class="roadmap-phase">PHASE / 03</div>
        <h3>Develop</h3>
        <p>Build educational tools, simulations, digital experiments, and prototypes. Record findings and improve projects through feedback.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="roadmap-step reveal delay-3">
        <div class="roadmap-phase">PHASE / 04</div>
        <h3>Connect</h3>
